{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29601","headline":"题白石莲花寄楚公 · 李商隐","name":"题白石莲花寄楚公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白石莲花谁所共，六时长捧佛前灯。\n空庭苔藓饶霜露，时梦西山老病僧。\n大海龙宫无限地，诸天雁塔几多层。\n漫夸鶖子真罗汉，不会牛车是上乘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}